  m_Name: Corn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WILCommunityGame.InformationTipSO
  text: Maize is one of South Africa's most important staple crops and is used to
    make foods such as pap. It provides carbohydrates that give our bodies energy.
    Growing maize can help provide an important source of food for families, although
    it needs enough water and space to grow successfully.
